{"4431080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horse Guys", "steam_appid": 4431080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be a horse and don't fall apart!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one horse controlled by two players. One player controls the front half, the other controls the back. Move together, stay connected, and survive ridiculous obstacles across colorful and unpredictable levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer: move and play together!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your trusted friend to your lobby to be your back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431080/extras/a175115374ab70df78eb66349d0e618d.poster.avif?t=1774736926\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431080/extras/a175115374ab70df78eb66349d0e618d.webm?t=1774736926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431080/extras/a175115374ab70df78eb66349d0e618d.mp4?t=1774736926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Local Co-Op!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your buddy, split the screen, and jump into the horse suit together! Local split-screen madness no online required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431080/extras/6c8053e14018a2f689cbbc70868b4696.poster.avif?t=1774736926\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4431080/extras/6c8053e14018a2f689cbbc70868b4696.webm?t=1774736926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><